ragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p013","mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p013:m0107","quote":"遐"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-ws2622004-rendered-wudi-sons","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p013","mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p013:m0125","quote":"遐"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-ws2622004-rendered-wudi-sons","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014","mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p014:m0135","quote":"康王"}],"identity_note":"清河王遐〔瑋遣收瓘者〕；本源角色可辨，未在NER期推定家系結構或未明世代。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-ws2622004-rendered-wudi-sons","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p001","quote":"武帝二十六男：楊元后生毗陵悼王軌、惠帝、秦獻王柬。審美人生城陽懷王景、楚隱王瑋、長沙厲王乂。徐才人生城陽殤王憲。匱才人生東海沖王祗。趙才人生始平哀王裕。趙美人生代哀王演。李夫人生淮南忠壯王允、吳孝王晏。嚴保林生新都懷王該。陳美人生清河康王遐。諸姬生汝陰哀王謨。程才人生成都王穎。王才人生孝懷帝。楊悼后生渤海殤王恢。餘八子不顯母氏，並早夭，又無封國及追諡，今並略之。其瑋、乂、穎自有傳。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p001:m0115","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p001:m0000"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-jin064-xia-father-wu","interpretation_note":"依本源明示生父接既有司馬鈞家族；ID字母只為唯一子支位置，不代表出生排行。收繼與母系另存，不改生父。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIA"}},{"id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAFB","label":"籥","status":"provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"籥","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p013:m0152","c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p015:m0000"]},{"surface":"新蔡王","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p015:m0003"]},{"surface":"清河王","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-064-wudi-sons-rendered:p015:m0012"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_